    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "sourceEntry": 81,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Why couldn’t I have had my first affair with somebody else? Why did it have to be my best friend who’s married to my other best friend?",
